# Adding a transcription backend

## What a new backend changes outside its own folder

Three files outside `Backends/` hold that set as well.

- the first surface, held by `AlphaGuardTests`
- the second surface, held by `BetaGuardTests`

That list is compared against every class in the test project that judges a
surface against the known set of backend names.

## A list somebody added later

- a surface this section invented, held by `GammaGuardTests`
